! this test will plot several scalar and vector first-order densities
! in the xy-, xz-, and yz-plane
! induced by the electric or magnetic field
! in x-, y-, and z-direction
! for different atoms and symmetries
!
!
! howto
! =====
!
! edit common.py (recommended, otherwise you get many many output files and a huge summary.htm)
! execute create_files.py
! run this test the usual way (using runtest)
! analyze using diff.py (which compares symmetries to C1 and creates summary.htm)
! grep FF0000 summary.htm (grep for red numbers)
! if you see nothing (no red numbers), be happy
